EXPLANATIONS={
 '冰':'The complete first original head lies between the preceding 公斤 repetition and the second 冰 repetition. The selected9.77–10.45 interval starts in the genuine gap after the preceding foreground has ended around9.45. A short b-like release near9.84 is followed by a complete high-front vowel body9.88–10.22, lower nasal continuation10.22–10.33 and finite decay through10.40. The next repetition begins only around10.89. Both unchanged whole sources explicitly locate 冰 after 公斤 and before 极/斤; actual printed bīng and the same-source repeated original head were compared with the retained pure 殯/ㄅㄧㄞ and supplemental CTC. The complete original nasal tail remains inside the selected cut. Original model zero-emission times do not represent a zero-duration recording or a certified nasal-place/tone result.',
 '笔记':'The selected5.71–6.68 interval contains the complete first original two-syllable 笔记 head after 认真 and before its own second repetition. The short initial release5.80–5.84 leads to the first high-i body5.84–6.10. A distinct palatal affrication at6.15–6.27 is followed by a separate high-i body6.27–6.51 and finite release through6.61. It is retained in its original entirety, rather than substituting the small-model 底气 prediction for the source head. Both complete original sources identify this exact printed bǐjì head; medium and CTC diagnostics, short consonantal structure, separate vowel nuclei and repeated source sequence were reviewed together. The preceding voice ends by5.62 and the second reading starts around7.00, outside both cuts. Original low-level background remains unchanged.',
 '句':'The complete original first standalone 句 head is between 讲 and the standalone second 句 reading, followed by 句子. The9.16–9.84 crop preserves the actual palatal release/affrication9.216–9.32, separate high/front rounded vowel9.32–9.77 and final weak decay9.77–9.82. The preceding voice has ended before9.05 and the next original reading begins after10.25. The actual original full-source 句 occurrence and printed jù/head order locate this complete word; the repeated high/front rounded body and subsequent 句子 head provide same-recording context. The actual pure 起/empty outputs are retained and are not treated as literal matches, certified aspiration measurements, or missing executions.',
 '地方':'The selected11.67–12.58 interval contains the first complete original 地方 after 工作日. A short d-like release11.76–11.80 and sustained i body11.80–12.10 are followed by distinct weak original f-like noise12.13–12.22, a separate weak vowel12.22–12.31, low nasal continuation12.31–12.43 and finite release before12.54. The first original weak fang syllable is retained with its nasal continuation; it is not clipped to the stronger di body. The preceding original foreground has ended before11.55 and the next complete repetition starts after13.00. Both unchanged whole sources locate 地方 at this exact source position; original printed dìfang and the second repeated head were reviewed alongside retained 第 1 法/蒂法 and CTC diagnostics. The quiet foreground gaps contain original background only, without replacement or filtering.',
 '礼物':'The selected2.82–3.8400625 interval contains the first complete original 礼物 head between 晚会 and its second 礼物 repetition. The l-like entry2.87–2.94 leads to the first complete i body2.94–3.15. After its original internal transition, the weak rounded/gliding entry3.35–3.42 retains original voiced structure into the separate u body3.42–3.76, followed by finite natural decay through3.82. No neighboring head begins before4.10. The unchanged original full source explicitly contains both 礼物 readings; exact printed lǐwù, the complete repeated two-syllable source, and actual pure 禮物/礼户 predictions were compared. The original rounded voiced transition is retained, without presenting the medium 户 spelling as a phone or tone certificate.'}
